# CNEN Gaming Privacy Policy

**Last Updated:** September 18, 2026

CNEN Gaming respects your privacy. This policy explains what information may be collected when using our Discord server, bots, website, and related services.

## Information We Collect

We may collect:

* Discord user ID, username, and server roles
* Messages, commands, and bot interactions
* Moderation records, reports, and appeals
* Information voluntarily provided through support tickets, applications, or forms

## How We Use Information

Information may be used to:

* Operate and improve CNEN Gaming services
* Provide support
* Moderate the community and enforce our rules
* Prevent abuse, spam, and other harmful activity
* Maintain features such as rankings, leveling, and statistics

## Information Sharing

We do **not** sell your personal information.

Information may be shared with trusted services or CNEN Gaming staff when reasonably necessary to operate our services, provide support, maintain security, or handle moderation matters.

## Data Retention

Information is retained only as long as reasonably necessary for its intended purpose, moderation, security, or legal obligations. Some records may remain after you leave the server.

## Your Rights

If you have questions about information collected by CNEN Gaming or wish to request information regarding your data, please contact the CNEN Gaming team.

## Changes to This Policy

CNEN Gaming may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected in this document with an updated **Last Updated** date.

By using CNEN Gaming services, you acknowledge this Privacy Policy.

